DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T204000
SUMMARY:Sweet 16mm – Those Awkward Years
LOCATION:MUBI Microcinema at Vidiots\, 4884 Eagle Rock Blvd\, Los Angeles\,
  CA 90041
URL:https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4466487/
DESCRIPTION:Run time: 100 min\n\nSeries: In the MUBI Microcinema\, Sweet 16
 mm\n\nWe're firing up our 16mm projector for a night of the best of pubert
 y's pitfalls and adolescence at its most awkward with a program of long-fo
 rgotten and laughably outdated short films from the 1940s through the 1980
 s about humanity's cringiest life stage with menstrucation's finest\, ende
 aring Mormon comedy shorts\, mid-century slut-shaming primers\, and more!\
 n\nTickets: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4466487/\n\nDetails: ht
 tps://vidiotsfoundation.org/movies/sweet-16mm-those-awkward-years/
END:VEVENT
